Hive Home Local
===============

This project incorporates code from the following open source projects:

HA-Hive-Local-Thermostat
------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/andrew-codechimp/HA-Hive-Local-Thermostat
Author:  Andrew Codechimp (@andrew-codechimp)
License: MIT

The following files in custom_components/hive_home_local/ are derived from
HA-Hive-Local-Thermostat with modifications to integrate with the unified
domain and device-family architecture of this project:

  hub_coordinator.py  (from coordinator.py)
  hub_climate.py      (from climate.py)
  hub_entity.py       (from entity.py)
  hub_binary_sensor.py (from binary_sensor.py)
  hub_sensor.py       (from sensor.py)
  hub_number.py       (from number.py)
  hub_select.py       (from select.py)
  hub_button.py       (from button.py)
  common.py
  diagnostics.py

Modifications made:
  - Domain renamed from hive_local_thermostat to hive_home_local
  - Class names prefixed with HiveHub* to avoid collisions with TRV classes
  - Import paths updated to reference hub_coordinator and hub_entity
  - Integration with shared const.py and config_flow.py

All hub device logic (SLR1, SLR2, OTR1 MQTT protocol handling, boost,
hot water control, diagnostics) is the work of @andrew-codechimp.


Hive-TRV-Local
--------------
Source:  https://github.com/gashwell/Hive-TRV-Local
Author:  Gary Ashwell (@gashwell)
License: MIT

The following files are derived from Hive-TRV-Local:

  trv_coordinator.py  (from coordinator.py)
  trv_climate.py      (from climate.py)
  trv_storage.py      (from storage.py)
  trv_schedule.py     (from schedule.py)
  trv_holiday.py      (from holiday.py)
  trv_presence.py     (from presence.py)
  trv_room.py         (from room.py)
  trv_sensor.py       (from sensor.py)
  trv_button.py       (from button.py)
  trv_number.py       (from number.py)
  trv_select.py       (from select.py)


